                </div><div class="col-lg-5 offset-lg-1 o_colored_level">
                    <p><span style="font-size: 22px;">Strategic Operational Base</span></p><p><span style="font-size: 17px;">Headquartered in Hong Kong—at the center of Asia's primary global sourcing networks, supply chains, and freight routing hubs.</span></p><p><br/></p><p><span style="font-size: 22px;">Regional Regulatory Alignment</span></p><p><span style="font-size: 16px;">Designed from the ground up to comply with regional privacy laws, including the Hong Kong PDPO (Personal Data Privacy Ordinanc</span><span class="h5-fs">e).</span></p><p><br/></p><p><span style="font-size: 22px;">Global Footprint</span></p><p><span style="font-size: 16px;">Built to empower global sourcing agencies, freight forwarders, 3PL providers, and regional trade hubs operating across cross-border trade lanes.</span></p>
                </div>
                
            </div>
        </div>
    </section><section class="s_title_split pt80 pb80 o_colored_level o_three_quarter_height" data-snippet="s_title_split" data-name="Title Split">
        <div class="s_allow_columns container">
            <div class="row">
                <div class="col-lg-6 o_colored_level">
                    <p style="font-weight: normal;"><span class="h2-fs"><font class="text-gradient" style="background-image: linear-gradient(135deg, rgb(47, 128, 237) 0%, rgb(178, 255, 218) 100%);">Enterprise Trust &amp;amp; Security.&amp;nbsp;</font></span></p>
                </div><div class="col-lg-5 offset-lg-1 o_colored_level">
                    <p><span style="font-size: 22px;">Strict AI Model Isolation:&amp;nbsp;</span></p><p><span style="font-size: 16px;">Your raw message data, quotes, and ledgers are never used to train, retrain, or fine-tune public or third-party AI models</span><span style="font-size: 18px;">.</span></p><p><span style="font-size: 22px;">OAuth 2.0 Access:&amp;nbsp;</span></p><p><span style="font-size: 16px;">Secure integration with Google Workspace and Microsoft 365 without ever viewing or storing your email account passwords.</span></p><p><span style="font-size: 22px;">Enterprise-Grade Encryption:</span></p><p><span style="font-size: 16px;">Full TLS 1.3 encryption in transit and AES-256 bit encryption at rest for all workspace ledgers.</span></p>
